    "summary_long": "The film introduces the most powerful man in the world, a figure whose authority is unmatched across nations and institutions. Through hubris or miscalculation, he has set in motion a catastrophic event that now threatens all of human civilization. Realizing the scale of the disaster he has caused, he becomes consumed by panic and guilt. He embarks on a frantic, globe-spanning mission to contain the damage and demonstrate that he alone can save humanity. Along the way, the story blends absurd comedic beats with somber dramatic turns as allies and enemies react to his erratic behavior. His efforts are undermined by his own flaws, as those around him question whether he is a savior or the source of the ruin. The narrative builds tension as time runs out and the disaster accelerates beyond control. Personal revelations force him to reckon with the cost of his power and the lives affected by his decisions. In the climax, he must choose between self-preservation and a final act of sacrifice. The ending leaves a bittersweet reflection on leadership, accountability, and the fragility of the world he sought to dominate.",
